    "tsenta-intel": {
      "path": "C:\\Users\\Dru\\Desktop\\Job STuff\\RavenX-CLI\\loot\\scans\\tsenta",
      "description": "Reverse-engineered Tsenta/autojobs.me intel: FULL_STACK_ANATOMY.md, internal_api_map.md, extension/ (detection engine), desktop/preload_bridge_dump.txt, traces, docs/. Read before building; copy, port, and reuse freely."
